    "heard from in the last 30 days": "近 30 天有請求",
    "The subagent effort set in magpie is {effort}; the model's supported levels and a routing group's fixed member effort still apply.": "magpie 為子代理設定的推理強度是 {effort}；仍按模型支援的等級適配，並保留路由群組成員的固定強度。",
    "{agent} guessed your next message for its composer by itself, reading the whole conversation again. Not a turn of the conversation; Codex composer predictions, under Settings in Codex's row on the Agents page, picks its model, and Codex's Settings › General › Show predictions turns it off.": "{agent} 自行為輸入框猜測你的下一則訊息，每次都把整段對話重讀一遍。不屬於對話輪次；在 Agent 頁 Codex 那一列的設定裡，用 Codex 輸入框預測 選它用的模型，在 Codex 的 設定 › 一般 › 顯示預測內容 裡可以關掉。",
