    "{failed}, the searcher picked in Settings › Models › Web search, didn't search for {whom}: {why}. So magpie had {searcher}, the next searcher it can use, search in its place. Not a turn of the conversation.": "{failed} 是在 設定 › 模型 › 聯網搜尋 裡選的代搜模型，但它沒能為 {whom} 搜尋：{why}。所以 magpie 改讓下一個可用的代搜模型 {searcher} 來搜。不屬於對話輪次。",
    "{failed}, the searcher magpie picked, didn't search for {whom}: {why}. So magpie had {searcher}, the next searcher it can use, search in its place. Not a turn of the conversation.": "{failed} 是 magpie 自動選的代搜模型，但它沒能為 {whom} 搜尋：{why}。所以 magpie 改讓下一個可用的代搜模型 {searcher} 來搜。不屬於對話輪次。",
